 1145 "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})-\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{25}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298515 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298516 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298517 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298518 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298519 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1041 "selection" 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1104 #edb/ref 17592186298516 13194139534607 true] [17592186298514 1110 #uuid "3f5d4375-0a26-5c04-8edc-ae110d5bfe82" 13194139534607 true] [17592186298515 1034 "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{25}+\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+C" 13194139534607 true] [17592186298515 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534607 true] [17592186298515 1111 #uuid "045bba7b-78ea-547e-b99c-4ec72d75b90a" 13194139534607 true] [17592186298516 1034 "\\